     0.0 phase BOARDING (cabin ready)
     0.5 play BoardingStarted (cabin ready)
     9.0 play BoardingWelcome (boarding)
    20.0 phase PUSHBACK (beacon on)
    30.0 phase TAKEOFF (lined up)
    70.0 phase CLIMB (airborne)
    70.5 play AfterTakeoff (airborne)
    96.0 phase CRUISE (levelled off)
    96.5 play TopOfClimbPilot (top of climb)
   220.5 play CruiseElapsed50Percent (half the route flown)
   250.5 play CruiseElapsed75Percent (three quarters of the route flown)
